  "details": "If you select a placement location and then look at an area you cannot place a portal on, the preview of the portal location gets stuck at the last position where it was possible to place it.\nYou can still confirm the placement of the portal if a red line / unplaceable is displayed in the preview, which allows you to place a portal miles away.\nPotential fix: Do not allow the portal to be placed if the preview shows that it cannot be placed, or enforce a maximum distance",
